msgstr "Obtener sugerencias de reposición"

#: views/inventory.py:583
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get products that need reordering based on sales velocity, lead time,\n"
"    and safety stock calculations.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Urgency Levels:**\n"
"    - `immediate`: Less than 7 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `soon`: 7-14 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `upcoming`: 14-30 days of supply remaining\n"
"\n"
"    **Reorder Formula:**\n"
"    `suggested_qty = velocity * (lead_days + safety_multiplier * lead_days) - current_stock`\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtener productos que necesitan reordenar según la velocidad de ventas, tiempo de entrega,\n"
"y cálculos de stock de seguridad.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasa:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"**Niveles de urgencia:**\n"
"- `inmediato`: Menos de 7 días de suministro restantes\n"
"- `pronto`: 7-14 días de suministro restantes\n"
"- `próximo`: 14-30 días de suministro restantes\n"
"\n"
"**Fórmula de reorden:**\n"
"`suggested_qty = velocity * (lead_days + safety_multiplier * lead_days) - current_stock`\n"
"    "

