#: views/messages.py:272
msgid "List customer messages"
msgstr "Listar mensajes del cliente"

#: views/messages.py:273
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of customer messages from all sources.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sources:**\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Messages from contact form submissions\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Customer notes attached to orders\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Messages are sorted by newest first by default.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Deep Linking:**\n"
#| "    - For `source='contact_form'`: Use `message_id` to navigate to message detail\n"
#| "    - For `source='order_note'`: Use `order_number` to navigate to order detail\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of customer messages from all sources.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Sources:**\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Messages from contact form submissions\n"
"    - `order_note`: Customer notes attached to orders\n"
"\n"
"    Messages are sorted by latest activity by default (most recent reply or creation time).\n"
"\n"
"    **Deep Linking:**\n"
"    - For `source='contact_form'`: Use `message_id` to navigate to message detail\n"
"    - For `source='order_note'`: Use `order_number` to navigate to order detail\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtener una lista paginada de mensajes de clientes de todas las fuentes.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasa:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"**Fuentes:**\n"
"- `contact_form`: Mensajes de envíos de formularios de contacto\n"
"- `order_note`: Notas del cliente adjuntas a pedidos\n"
"\n"
"Los mensajes se ordenan por actividad más reciente de forma predeterminada (hora de la última respuesta o creación).\n"
"\n"
"**Enlaces profundos:**\n"
"- Para `source='contact_form'`: Use `message_id` para navegar al detalle del mensaje\n"
"- Para `source='order_note'`: Use `order_number` para navegar al detalle del pedido\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:293
msgid "Filter by source: 'all', 'contact_form', 'order_note'"
msgstr "Filtrar por fuente: 'all', 'contact_form', 'order_note'"

#: views/messages.py:301
