msgstr "Fuente inválida. Debe ser \"contact_form\" o \"order_note\"."

#: views/messages.py:599
msgid "Update message status"
msgstr "Actualizar estado del mensaje"

#: views/messages.py:600
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Update the status of a customer message.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **URL Format:** `/messages/{source}/{id}/status/`\n"
"    - `source`: Either 'contact_form' or 'order_note'\n"
"    - `id`: The message ID within that source\n"
"\n"
"    **Status Options:**\n"
"    - read: Mark as read\n"
"    - replied: Mark as replied (contact_form only)\n"
"    - archived: Archive the message (contact_form only)\n"
"\n"
"    Note: OrderNotes only support 'read' status.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Actualizar el estado de un mensaje del cliente.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasa:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"**Formato de URL:** `/messages/{source}/{id}/status/`\n"
"- `source`: 'contact_form' o 'order_note'\n"
"- `id`: El ID del mensaje dentro de ese origen\n"
"\n"
"**Opciones de estado:**\n"
"- read: Marcar como leído\n"
"- replied: Marcar como respondido (solo contact_form)\n"
"- archived: Archivar el mensaje (solo contact_form)\n"
"\n"
"Nota: OrderNotes solo admiten el estado 'read'.\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:642 views/orders.py:514 views/products.py:574
msgid "Invalid status update."
msgstr "Actualización de estado inválida."

#: views/messages.py:705
msgid "Order notes only support \"read\" status."
msgstr "Las notas de pedidos solo admiten el estado \"leído\"."

#: views/messages.py:741
msgid "Message status updated successfully."
msgstr "Estado del mensaje actualizado con éxito."

#: views/messages.py:750
msgid "Get unread message count"
msgstr "Obtener recuento de mensajes no leídos"

#: views/messages.py:751
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get the count of unread customer messages from all sources.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Useful for badge display in the app.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Returns breakdown by source:\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Unread contact form submissions\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Unread customer notes on orders\n"
#| "    - `total`: Combined total\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get the count of unread customer messages for the current user.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    Useful for badge display in the app. Counts are per-user — a message\n"
"    is \"unread\" if the current staff member has not read it yet, regardless\n"
"    of whether other staff members have.\n"
"\n"
"    Returns breakdown by source:\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Unread contact form submissions for this user\n"
"    - `order_note`: Unread customer notes on orders for this user\n"
"    - `total`: Combined total\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtener el recuento de mensajes de clientes no leídos para el usuario actual.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasa:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"Útil para mostrar el badge en la aplicación. Los recuentos son por usuario — un mensaje\n"
"se considera \"no leído\" si el miembro del personal actual aún no lo ha leído, independientemente\n"
"de si otros miembros del personal lo han leído.\n"
"\n"
"Devuelve el desglose por fuente:\n"
"- `contact_form`: Envíos de formularios de contacto no leídos para este usuario\n"
"- `order_note`: Notas de clientes en pedidos no leídos para este usuario\n"
"- `total`: Total combinado\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:819
msgid "Get message counts by status"
msgstr "Obtener recuentos de mensajes por estado"

#: views/messages.py:820
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get count of messages by status and source for badge display.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Returns counts for both sources:\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Full status breakdown (unread, read, replied, archived)\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Simple status (unread, read)\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get count of messages by status and source for badge display.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    The `unread_by_me` field shows messages the current user has not read,\n"
"    regardless of the message's global status.\n"
"\n"
"    Returns counts for both sources:\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Full status breakdown (unread, read, replied, archived)\n"
"    - `order_note`: Simple status (unread, read)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtener recuento de mensajes por estado y fuente para mostrar el badge.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasa:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"El campo `unread_by_me` muestra mensajes que el usuario actual aún no ha leído,\n"
"independientemente del estado global del mensaje.\n"
"\n"
"Devuelve recuentos para ambas fuentes:\n"
"- `contact_form`: Desglose completo de estado (no leído, leído, respondido, archivado)\n"
"- `order_note`: Estado simple (no leído, leído)\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:908
msgid "Reply to customer message"
msgstr "Responder al mensaje del cliente"

#: views/messages.py:909
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Reply to a customer message from the contact form.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **URL Format:** `/messages/contact_form/{id}/reply/`\n"
"\n"
"    This endpoint:\n"
"    1. Stores the reply text against the message\n"
"    2. Updates message status to 'replied'\n"
"    3. Optionally sends an email to the customer\n"
"\n"
"    Note: This endpoint only works for `contact_form` messages.\n"
"    For order notes, use the order notes reply endpoint instead.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Responda a un mensaje del cliente del formulario de contacto.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasa:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"**Formato de URL:** `/messages/contact_form/{id}/reply/`\n"
"\n"
"Este punto final:\n"
"1. Almacena el texto de la respuesta asociado al mensaje\n"
"2. Actualiza el estado del mensaje a 'respondido'\n"
"3. Opcionalmente envía un correo electrónico al cliente\n"
"\n"
"Nota: Este punto final solo funciona para mensajes de `contact_form`.\n"
"Para notas de pedidos, use el punto final de respuesta de notas de pedidos en su lugar.\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:952
msgid "Invalid reply data."
msgstr "Datos de respuesta inválidos."

#: views/orders.py:47
msgid "List orders"
msgstr "Listar pedidos"

#: views/orders.py:48
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of orders with filtering and sorting.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Filtering:**\n"
#| "    Use either `status` for a specific status or `filter_type` for status groups.\n"
#| "    If `status` is provided (not 'all'), `filter_type` is ignored.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Filter Types (groups):**\n"
#| "    - all: All orders (default)\n"
#| "    - open: Orders with status pending or processing\n"
#| "    - completed: Orders with status shipped or delivered\n"
#| "    - refunded: Orders with status refunded or cancelled\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sort Options:**\n"
#| "    - -created_at: Newest first (default)\n"
#| "    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
#| "    - -total_amount: Highest value first\n"
#| "    - total_amount: Lowest value first\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of orders with filtering and sorting.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Filtering:**\n"
"    Use either `status` for a specific status or `filter_type` for status groups.\n"
"    If `status` is provided (not 'all'), `filter_type` is ignored.\n"
"\n"
"    **Filter Types (groups):**\n"
"    - all: All orders (default)\n"
"    - open: Orders with status pending or processing\n"
"    - completed: Orders with status shipped or delivered\n"
"    - refunded: Orders with status refunded or cancelled\n"
"\n"
"    **Sort Options:**\n"
"    - -created_at: Newest first (default)\n"
"    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
"    - -total_amount: Highest value first\n"
"    - total_amount: Lowest value first\n"
"    - -updated_at: Recently updated first\n"
"    - updated_at: Least recently updated first\n"
"    - customer_name: Customer name A-Z\n"
"    - -customer_name: Customer name Z-A\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtener una lista paginada de pedidos con filtrado y ordenación.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasas:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"**Filtrado:**\n"
"Use `status` para un estado específico o `filter_type` para grupos de estado.\n"
"Si se proporciona `status` (no 'all'), `filter_type` se ignora.\n"
"\n"
"**Tipos de filtro (grupos):**\n"
"- all: Todos los pedidos (por defecto)\n"
"- open: Pedidos con estado pendiente o en proceso\n"
"- completed: Pedidos con estado enviado o entregado\n"
"- refunded: Pedidos con estado reembolsado o cancelado\n"
"\n"
"**Opciones de ordenación:**\n"
"- -created_at: Más reciente primero (por defecto)\n"
"- created_at: Más antiguo primero\n"
"- -total_amount: Valor más alto primero\n"
"- total_amount: Valor más bajo primero\n"
"- -updated_at: Actualizado recientemente primero\n"
"- updated_at: Menos recientemente actualizado primero\n"
"- customer_name: Nombre del cliente A-Z\n"
"- -customer_name: Nombre del cliente Z-A\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:79
msgid ""
"Filter type: 'all', 'open', 'completed', 'refunded'. Ignored if 'status' is "
