#: views/products.py:57
msgid "List products"
msgstr "Listar productos"

#: views/products.py:58
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of products with filtering and sorting.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Stock Status Filter:**\n"
#| "    - all: All products (default)\n"
#| "    - in_stock: Products with available stock > low_stock_threshold\n"
#| "    - low_stock: Products with 0 < available stock <= low_stock_threshold\n"
#| "    - out_of_stock: Products with available stock <= 0\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sort Options (use 'ordering' parameter):**\n"
#| "    - name: Name A-Z\n"
#| "    - -name: Name Z-A\n"
#| "    - -created_at: Newest first\n"
#| "    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
#| "    - stock_quantity: Lowest stock first\n"
#| "    - -stock_quantity: Highest stock first\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of products with filtering and sorting.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Stock Status Filter:**\n"
"    - all: All products (default)\n"
"    - in_stock: Products with available stock > low_stock_threshold\n"
"    - low_stock: Products with 0 < available stock <= low_stock_threshold\n"
"    - out_of_stock: Products with available stock <= 0\n"
"\n"
"    **Sort Options (use 'ordering' parameter):**\n"
"    - name: Name A-Z\n"
"    - -name: Name Z-A\n"
"    - -created_at: Newest first\n"
"    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
"    - stock_quantity: Lowest stock first\n"
"    - -stock_quantity: Highest stock first\n"
"    - price: Price low to high\n"
"    - -price: Price high to low\n"
"    - -updated_at: Recently updated first\n"
"    - updated_at: Least recently updated first\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtener una lista paginada de productos con filtrado y ordenación.\n"
"\n"
"**Límite de tasas:** 300 solicitudes por minuto\n"
"\n"
"**Filtro de estado de stock:**\n"
"- all: Todos los productos (por defecto)\n"
"- in_stock: Productos con stock disponible > low_stock_threshold\n"
"- low_stock: Productos con 0 < stock disponible <= low_stock_threshold\n"
"- out_of_stock: Productos con stock disponible <= 0\n"
"\n"
"**Opciones de ordenación (use el parámetro 'ordering'):\n"
"- name: Nombre A-Z\n"
"- -name: Nombre Z-A\n"
"- -created_at: Más reciente primero\n"
"- created_at: Más antiguo primero\n"
"- stock_quantity: Stock más bajo primero\n"
"- -stock_quantity: Stock más alto primero\n"
"- price: Precio de menor a mayor\n"
"- -price: Precio de mayor a menor\n"
"- -updated_at: Actualizado recientemente primero\n"
"- updated_at: Menos recientemente actualizado primero\n"
"    "

